{"id":"622259","name":"韭菜猪肉薄饼","author":"笑笑昵","authorId":"10878013","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/622259/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"韭菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"猪肉馅","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材:韭菜洗净切碎，猪肉馅。","img":"images/622259/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"肉馅中放入盐、胡椒粉、生抽、酱油、蚝油。","img":"images/622259/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/622259/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入韭菜拌匀。","img":"images/622259/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入两勺食用油拌匀","img":"images/622259/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"面粉温水揉成面团后醒半小时，分成小剂子。","img":"images/622259/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"擀成皮。","img":"images/622259/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入韭菜肉馅。","img":"images/622259/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"包成包子。","img":"images/622259/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"撒上干面粉慢慢擀成薄饼。","img":"images/622259/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"电饼铛中刷油，放入薄饼。","img":"images/622259/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"煎至两面金黄即可。","img":"images/622259/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/622259/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}